This directory contains a copy of the mDNS service from Firefox.

  - URL: https://github.com/mozilla-firefox/firefox
  - Commit: 7d8644b9d4470a675bf670c2dc7664cc01f14ece
  - Directory: dom/media/webrtc/transport/mdns_service

The simplest way of updating its contents is to re-create the directory
from scratch, and restoring the needed files with Git. Example commands:

  rm -rf Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs/*
  cp -ar ../path/to/firefox/dom/media/webrtc/transport/mdns_service/* Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs/
  git checkout -- \
      Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs/README.WebKit \
      Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs/.cargo \
      Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs/0001-mdns_service-Remove-gecko-profiler-dependency.patch
  cd Source/ThirdParty/mdns-service-rs
  cat 0001-mdns_service-Remove-gecko-profiler-dependency.patch | patch -p6
  cargo vendor --locked

Then check whether the updated sources require any changes to the CMake build system, and update the
git commit identifier and tag in this file.
